cpp/ — optional C++ wrapper
===========================

Header-only wrapper around the librsvg-2.0 C API.  It is not compiled,
linked, or installed by `make` / `make install` / `make check`.

  librsvg.hpp  RAII `rsvg::Handle` (owns RsvgHandle, unrefs in the destructor)
  example.cpp  load, render_document, write a PNG

Include `librsvg.hpp` and link the C library as usual:

    c++ -std=c++11 -I. example.cpp \
        $(pkg-config --cflags --libs librsvg-2.0 cairo cairo-png)

Run from this directory so `../examples/icon.svg` is found.

Load from a file, memory, or GFile.  Failures throw `rsvg::Error`
(a `std::runtime_error` with the GError message).  Nothing here
changes rendering, CSS, limits, or the C ABI.
